@startuml AddTask
title Week 11 — Add a normal task (main success scenario)
actor User
boundary "Task input / Add button" as Input
participant "Add click handler in main.js" as Main
participant "history: CommandHistory" as History
participant "command: AddTaskCommand" as Command
participant "controller: TodoController" as Controller
participant "proxy: ConfirmDeleteProxy" as Proxy
participant "logging: LoggingTodoServiceDecorator" as Logging
participant "service: TodoService" as Service
participant "builder: TaskBuilder" as Builder
participant "task: Task" as Task
participant "storage: StorageGroup" as Storage
participant "list: LocalStorageHandler" as List
participant "archive: ArchiveStorageHandler" as Archive
participant "Browser localStorage" as BrowserStorage
participant "renderer: TodoRenderer" as Renderer
boundary "Task container / document" as DOM
participant "counter: TaskCounter" as Counter
boundary "task-counter element" as CounterDisplay

note over Controller, Renderer
  Factory has created and injected the service's storage.
  Saved records are loaded and action callbacks are bound.
  Main has subscribed and initialized the counter on the raw service.
end note
User -> Input : type "Buy milk" and click Add Task
Input -> Main : click
activate Main
Main -> Command : new AddTaskCommand(controller, input.value)
Main -> History : run(command)
activate History
History -> Command : execute()
activate Command
Command -> Controller : addTask(description)
activate Controller
Controller -> Proxy : addTask(description)
activate Proxy
Proxy -> Logging : addTask(description)
activate Logging
Logging -> Logging : console.log: LOG: addTask, description
Logging -> Service : addTask(description)
activate Service
Service -> Service : validate(description)\ntrim, check length, preserve long-list warning
Service -> Builder : new TaskBuilder(trimmed)
Service -> Builder : build()
activate Builder
Builder -> Task : new Task(builder)
activate Task
Task --> Builder : task with existing persisted fields
deactivate Task
Builder --> Service : task
deactivate Builder
Service -> Service : store(task); tasks.push(task)
Service -> Storage : save(tasks)
activate Storage
Storage -> List : save(tasks)
activate List
List -> BrowserStorage : setItem('todo-tasks', JSON.stringify(tasks))
activate BrowserStorage
BrowserStorage --> List : undefined
deactivate BrowserStorage
List --> Storage : undefined
deactivate List
Storage -> Archive : save(tasks)
activate Archive
Archive -> BrowserStorage : getItem('todo-archive')
BrowserStorage --> Archive : saved archive or null
Archive -> Archive : append only previously unseen task IDs
Archive -> BrowserStorage : setItem('todo-archive', JSON.stringify(archive))
Archive --> Storage : undefined
deactivate Archive
Storage --> Service : undefined
deactivate Storage
Service -> Service : notify()
loop registered observers (TaskCounter in this app)
  Service -> Counter : update(tasks)
  activate Counter
  Counter -> CounterDisplay : set textContent to open / done counts
  Counter --> Service : undefined
  deactivate Counter
end
Service --> Logging : task.id
deactivate Service
Logging --> Proxy : task.id
deactivate Logging
Proxy --> Controller : task.id
deactivate Proxy
Controller -> Renderer : render(service-compatible object, newId)
activate Renderer
Renderer -> Renderer : build pending/completed rows\nfind oldest pending description
Renderer -> Proxy : getWorkloadSummary()
activate Proxy
Proxy -> Logging : getWorkloadSummary()
activate Logging
Logging -> Service : getWorkloadSummary()
activate Service
Service --> Logging : workload summary
deactivate Service
Logging --> Proxy : workload summary
deactivate Logging
Proxy --> Renderer : workload summary
deactivate Proxy
Renderer -> DOM : update lists, status and title\nbind action callbacks; flash new row
Renderer --> Controller : undefined
deactivate Renderer
Controller --> Command : newId
deactivate Controller
Command -> Command : remember id
Command --> History : newId
deactivate Command
History -> History : keep successful command in done
History --> Main : undefined
deactivate History
Main -> Input : clear input
deactivate Main
DOM --> User : saved task visible in To do

note over Service, DOM
  Short descriptions return null with no save, notification, or redraw.
  No failed command is kept; normal Add still clears input.
  Urgent additions use addUrgentTask() and the builder's
  high-priority / URGENT-label recipe, not a type string.
end note
@enduml
